silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_10_trace_leg_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "TraceLegYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_10_trace_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'TraceLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Trace Leg', the trace_leg_arrow AuditTrail_77 -> MittensColimitApex: the PROV-O audit-trail leg; monic (this specific audit trail is unique to VetRecord_77 and thus to Mittens in this diagram) but not epic.; also, In 'Trace Leg', the record_trace_arrow VetRecord_77 -> AuditTrail_77 records that VetRecord_77 is the subject of this audit trail; monic because AuditTrail_77 traces exactly this one record." .
